## Notes
- Three cells have n < 20 (black/female = 16, hipanic/female = 9, white/female = 12); cell medians are unstable and reported only descriptively.
- Female median = $0 in the two minority-race cells, so the within-race male/female ratio is undefined (infinite).
- 1985 wealth precedes most jail spells (1985-1994) used to define ever_jailed; findings are descriptive associations, not causal effects.
- 'hipanic' is the literal label in the file (sic). Negative composite_wealth values (~5.4% of all rows) are retained; medians are unweighted.
